 "provenance": {
  "author": "DanTerm",
  "notes": "Live PTY recording of zsh with the bundled danterm.zsh integration and Starship, swept one column at a time from 100 to 60. zsh repaints its whole prompt on SIGWINCH, so the dialect declares redraw=1. The prompt is two rows with a right-aligned segment padded to the full terminal width -- the shape that re-wraps under reflow and produced the original resize staircase.",
